id: ot_cpc_transport_posix
label: CPC transport (POSIX host)
package: openthread
category: OpenThread|Host Support
quality: production
description: Support for spinel transport interface over Cpc on Posix Host.

provides:
- name: ot_cpc_transport_posix

library:
- system: cpc
- system: stdc++

include:
- path: platform-abstraction/posix
  file_list:
  - path: cpc_transport.hpp
  - path: cpc_transport_config.hpp

source:
- path: platform-abstraction/posix/cpc_transport.cpp

metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
root_path: openthread
